about=page_hero('About','Welcome to Treasure Trove','A garden. A gathering.<br><em>A memory to keep.</em>','In Batac, Ilocos Norte, Treasure Trove Resort brings together time in nature, shared meals, celebrations, and relaxing stays.')+f'''<section class="page-section"><div class="wrap">{row('garden','The Treasure Trove experience','For the people<br><em>and moments that matter.</em>','Treasure Trove describes itself as a garden resort for meaningful gatherings and heartfelt celebrations. Its setting brings together a function hall, outdoor garden, dining areas, a swimming pool, and guest accommodations.',linktext='Explore the venue',href='/venue/')}{row('garden-dining','Time well spent','A table under the trees.<br><em>A reason to stay.</em>','A family meal. A café catch-up. An occasion that brings everyone together. From the restaurant’s garden dining to Tahan Cafe, sharing time is part of the experience.',linktext='Plan your visit',href='/contact/',reverse=True)}</div></section><section class="section soft-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="center"><p class="eyebrow">In Magnuang, Batac City</p><h2>Rooted in a<br><em>welcoming setting.</em></h2><p class="subtext">Find the resort on National Road and discover the spaces for yourself. Arrange a visit to discuss your plans, see the venue, and ask the team your questions.</p><div class="button-row" style="justify-content:center">{btn('Arrange a Venue Visit','/contact/?interest=a%20venue%20visit#inquiry')}{btn('Get Directions',MAP,'outline')}</div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="sources"><div class="wrap privacy-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Information & photography</p><h2>Grounded in <em>real Treasure Trove.</em></h2><p>Contact details, the address, brand imagery, restaurant hours, and the Facebook recommendation figure were checked against the resort’s official Facebook page on 14 October 2026. Current rates and booking availability are confirmed directly by the resort.</p><ul><li><a href="{FACEBOOK}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official Treasure Trove Resort Facebook page ↗</a> — business details, logo, exterior, garden and event photography.</li><li><a href="{TRIP}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Treasure Trove Resort on Trip.com ↗</a> — hotel-uploaded rooms, pool, dining and garden photography; guest rating of 9.3/10 from 7 reviews when viewed.</li><li><a href="https://batac.com/listings/treasure-trove-resort/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Batac.com resort listing ↗</a> — additional address and phone verification.</li><li><a href="https://www.bertlozadaswimschool.com/ilocos/420-ilocos-treasure-trove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bert Lozada Swim School venue listing ↗</a> — outdoor pool and venue location.</li></ul><p>Photographs show the actual property and retain their source watermarks where present. For the most recent facilities, menus, event arrangements, and promotions, contact Treasure Trove Resort.</p></div></section>{banner()}'''
contact=page_hero('Contact','Start your Treasure Trove moment','Something special<br><em>starts with a hello.</em>','Tell us what you’re planning. Prepare a detailed inquiry, then send it directly to the resort by email or Facebook Messenger.',False)+f'''<section class="page-section" id="inquiry"><div class="wrap contact-layout"><div class="contact-details"><p class="eyebrow">Let’s connect</p><h2>We’d love to<br><em>hear your plans.</em></h2><p class="subtext">For an event, a stay, a swim, or a meal together, get in touch with Treasure Trove Resort.</p><div class="contact-item"><p class="eyebrow">Call or message</p><a href="tel:+639978827572">0997 882 7572</a><small>Philippines · +63 997 882 7572</small><a class="text-link" href="sms:+639978827572" style="font-size:11px;margin-top:10px">Send a text message ↗</a></div><div class="contact-item"><p class="eyebrow">Email</p><a href="mailto:info@treasuretroveph.com">info@treasuretroveph.com</a></div><div class="contact-item"><p class="eyebrow">Visit us</p><address>{ADDRESS}</address>{textlink('Get Directions',MAP)}</div><div class="contact-item"><p class="eyebrow">Find us on Facebook</p><div class="contact-socials">{textlink('Messenger',MESSENGER)}{textlink('Facebook Page',FACEBOOK)}</div></div><div class="hours"><b>Restaurant hours</b><p>Thursday–Monday · 10:00 AM–8:45 PM<br>Closed Tuesday & Wednesday.<br>Tahan Cafe is open daily; ask for café hours.<br>Contact the resort for pool and visit schedules.</p></div></div><form class="quote-form" id="quote-form"><p class="eyebrow">Plan your event or stay</p><h2>Request a <em>quotation.</em></h2><p>Share a few details. You’ll review your inquiry and choose email or Messenger to send it.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="form-field"><label for="name">Your name *</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Full name"></div><div class="form-field"><label for="mobile">Mobile number *</label><input id="mobile" name="mobile" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required minlength="7" maxlength="25" pattern="[+0-9 ()\\-]{{7,25}}" title="Enter a phone number using digits, spaces, +, parentheses or hyphens" placeholder="09XX XXX XXXX"></div><div class="form-field full"><label for="email">Email address <span style="font-weight:400">(optional)</span></label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="150" placeholder="you@example.com"></div><div class="form-field full-mobile"><label for="event">Type of event or visit *</label><select id="event" name="event" required>{options}</select></div><div class="form-field full-mobile"><label for="date">Preferred event / arrival date *</label><input id="date" name="date" type="date" required aria-describedby="date-help"></div><div class="form-field full"><label for="guests">Estimated number of guests *</label><input id="guests" name="guests" type="number" min="1" max="10000" required placeholder="Your expected guest count" inputmode="numeric"></div><fieldset><legend>Accommodation needed?</legend><div class="radio-row"><label><input type="radio" name="accommodation" value="Yes" required>Yes</label><label><input type="radio" name="accommodation" value="No" checked>No</label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Catering needed?</legend><div class="radio-row"><label><input type="radio" name="catering" value="Yes" required>Yes</label><label><input type="radio" name="catering" value="No" checked>No</label></div></fieldset><div class="form-field full"><label for="message">Message / additional requirements</label><textarea id="message" name="message" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Tell us about your occasion, preferred setup, dining plans, overnight dates, or any special requests."></textarea></div></div><p class="form-help" id="date-help">An inquiry does not reserve your date. The resort confirms availability, rates, and booking terms directly.</p><button class="btn form-submit" type="submit" disabled>Request a Quotation <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="form-help" style="margin-bottom:0">Your details stay in this browser until you choose to send them using your email app or Messenger. <a href="/privacy/" style="text-decoration:underline">Privacy information</a></p><noscript><p>To request a quotation, email <a href="mailto:info@treasuretroveph.com">info@treasuretroveph.com</a> with your occasion, date, and guest count, or call 0997 882 7572.</p></noscript></form></div></section><section class="contact-map"><div class="wrap"><div class="map-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Come see the setting</p><h2>Find us <em>in Batac.</em></h2></div>{textlink('Open Directions',MAP)}</div><iframe class="map-frame" title="Map showing Treasure Trove Resort’s location in Magnuang, Batac" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=18.019129904193,120.53270637989&z=15&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></section><dialog id="quote-dialog" class="quote-dialog" aria-labelledby="quote-title"><button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close inquiry preview">×</button><p class="eyebrow">One more step</p><h2 id="quote-title">Your inquiry is <em>ready.</em></h2><p>Choose how to send it below. Your request reaches the resort after you send it in your email app or Messenger.</p><label for="prepared-inquiry" class="eyebrow" style="font-size:9px">Your prepared message</label><textarea id="prepared-inquiry" readonly></textarea><div class="button-row"><a class="btn" id="send-email">Open Email Draft ↗</a><button class="btn outline" id="copy-inquiry">Copy for Messenger</button></div><p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="manual"><a href="{MESSENGER}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Facebook Messenger ↗</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="tel:+639978827572">Call the resort</a></p><p class="manual">If your email app doesn’t open, copy the message and email it to info@treasuretroveph.com.</p></dialog>'''
privacy=page_hero('Privacy','Your inquiry details','A little clarity<br><em>about your information.</em>','How this website handles the information you enter.',False)+'''<section class="page-section"><div class="wrap privacy-copy"><h2>Your inquiry form</h2><p>The form prepares a message in your browser. This website does not submit your inquiry to a server, store it in a database, or send it automatically. Form values remain on the open page and are not saved by the site when you leave.</p><p>When you choose Open Email Draft, your email application receives the prepared message. When you choose Copy for Messenger, the message is copied to your clipboard so you can paste it into Facebook Messenger. Review your details and send the message yourself. The resort receives only the information you choose to send.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Links to Facebook, Messenger, Google Maps, Trip.com, and other source websites open services with their own privacy policies. The location map uses Google Maps. Fonts are served locally. This website does not add advertising trackers or analytics.</p><h2>After you contact the resort</h2><p>For questions about how Treasure Trove Resort handles information sent to it, contact info@treasuretroveph.com or 0997 882 7572.</p><p>Last updated: 14 October 2026.</p></div></section>'''
